        "memorization_risk": "NO DIRECT REPLICATION DETECTED; LOCAL PROXIMITY REQUIRES CAUTIOUS INTERPRETATION",
        "scientific_conclusion": "Phase 2B detected no exact or tested rounded row-level replication between the synthetic dataset and REAL_TRAIN. The overall synthetic-to-real nearest-neighbor distribution was broadly comparable to the empirical REAL_TRAIN-to-REAL_TRAIN baseline, with a slightly lower synthetic median distance. However, a higher proportion of synthetic observations occupied the closest diagnostic proximity regions at selected thresholds. Because these thresholds are researcher-defined and nearest-neighbor proximity can arise naturally from dense empirical regions, these observations do not establish memorization. The results therefore provide evidence against direct row-level replication while supporting cautious interpretation of local proximity and motivating subsequent downstream robustness evaluation."
    }
